{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1468134-tc-aberrant-why-immunity-over-adaptation-for-defense-against-poisons-diseases","id":1468134,"title":"(TC: Aberrant)Why Immunity over Adaptation for defense against poisons/diseases?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-17T08:11:39-08:00","id":1468134,"title":"(TC: Aberrant)Why Immunity over Adaptation for defense against poisons/diseases?","content":"Is there any benefit for choosing Immunity over Adaptation (assuming Quantum and Mega-Stamina 3) re: resisting poisons and diseases. other than &quot;it fits the character&quot; or &quot;if you take both, it blunts the loss from power loss&quot; reasons. I do think Immunity should provide Mega-Stamina Scale resistance to poisons/diseases, rather than just straight Scale, just to balance things out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2176-spectaculartentacular","name":"SpectacularTentacular","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2176_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-17T12:04:27-08:00","id":1468166,"title":"","content":"If you think Damage Rating goes in general between 1 and 5, and immunity reduce the damage by 1 per dot, it will reduce to 0 almost anything, and anything that is stronger than that will hardly do any damage as the character will roll to reduce it further after.<br /> <br /> if you add scale, first, there will be a chance of failing and not getting any protection (what doesn\u2019t happens this way) and the second dot in Mega Stamina would take any damage raring to 0, unless you are talking about throwing people into stars and things like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-17T12:51:02-08:00","id":1468172,"title":"","content":"They're two different things. Adaptation gives you defense against hostile environments. Anything from hard vacuum, to the crushing weight of the sea floor, to a nuclear reactor leak. Immunity protects you from diseases, poisons, and things like that. Choose the one which fits what you want. Want to walk on the moon unaided? Take Adaptation. Want to drink the contents of a distillery? Take Immunity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-17T13:05:23-08:00","id":1468173,"title":"","content":"Technically, there is overlap; for instance, the problem with heart radiation is that it leads to radiation poisoning; and I could see someone arguing for immunity to radiation poisoning to get the same effect as being able to adapt to a high radiation environment. There may be a few other cases like that. But in general, yeah. If it's an environmental hazard, you want adaptation; if it's something internal, you want immunity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}